---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteNav from '../components/SiteNav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout title="How the RoleForge pipeline works" description="Explore how RoleForge analyzes a portfolio, maps evidence to a job, and prepares an auditable application.">
  <SiteNav active="pipeline" />

  <main class="site-main">
    <section class="pipeline-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> THE COMPILER, UNDER THE HOOD</p>
        <h1>From source code to<br /><em>source-backed</em> story.</h1>
        <p>Follow how RoleForge turns portfolio artifacts into an application snapshot. Each stage keeps candidate evidence, job requirements, and generated claims distinct.</p>
        <div class="pipeline-meta"><span>01 / REPOSITORY</span><i></i><span>02 / REQUIREMENTS</span><i></i><span>03 / REVIEWABLE OUTPUT</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="diagram-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="diagram-heading">
          <div><p class="section-label">Interactive architecture</p><h2 class="display-heading">The RoleForge pipeline</h2></div>
          <span class="diagram-note">PAN · ZOOM · INSPECT</span>
        </div>
        <div class="diagram-card fade-up">
          <div class="diagram-toolbar"><span><i></i> ROLEFORGE / WORKFLOW MAP</span><span>11 STAGES · EVIDENCE FIRST</span></div>
          <iframe src="/pipeline-diagram.html" title="Interactive RoleForge application pipeline diagram" loading="eager"></iframe>
          <div class="diagram-caption"><span>Move through the diagram to inspect the data passed between each stage.</span><a href="/pipeline-diagram.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open diagram in a new tab ↗</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <section class="site-section">
      <div class="container two-column">
        <div class="section-header fade-up">
          <p class="section-label">Evidence provenance</p>
          <h2 class="display-heading">Every useful claim has a trail.</h2>
          <p class="section-intro">A project description, a language in source files, or a dependency in a manifest can support a claim. The output keeps the path visible so you can check what it actually says.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="provenance-card fade-up d2">
          <div class="provenance-top"><span>CLAIM TRACE</span><span>EXAMPLE / SYNTHETIC</span></div>
          <div class="claim-node"><small>RESUME CLAIM</small><strong>Built an ESP32 weather station</strong></div>
          <div class="trace-line"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="claim-node project-node"><small>PROJECT</small><strong>AeroSense</strong><p>Environmental monitoring with sensor integration</p></div>
          <div class="source-nodes"><span>README.md</span><span>firmware/main.cpp</span><span>platformio.ini</span></div>
          <div class="trace-status"><span>✓</span> Candidate claims stay tied to their evidence</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <section class="site-section matching-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header fade-up">
          <p class="section-label">Requirement matching</p>
          <h2 class="display-heading">A match is a link, not a rewrite.</h2>
          <p class="section-intro">The job defines what it asks for. The portfolio shows what can be supported. RoleForge surfaces direct matches, transferable evidence, and gaps separately.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="matching-grid fade-up d2">
          <article class="matching-card">
            <span class="matching-index">01 / JOB</span>
            <h3>“C++ firmware development”</h3>
            <p>Required skill</p>
          </article>
          <div class="matching-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
          <article class="matching-card matching-evidence">
            <span class="matching-index">02 / PORTFOLIO</span>
            <h3>Weather station firmware</h3>
            <p>README.md · firmware/main.cpp</p>
          </article>
          <div class="matching-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
          <article class="matching-card matching-result">
            <span class="matching-index">03 / ASSESSMENT</span>
            <h3>Direct evidence</h3>
            <p>Source-backed, ready for your review</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="gap-callout fade-up d3"><span>VISIBLE GAP</span><p>If the posting asks for a technology the portfolio does not show, RoleForge reports the gap instead of adding it to the resume.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pipeline-cta">
      <div class="container cta-inner">
        <div><p class="section-label">Ready to see it run?</p><h2 class="display-heading">Walk through a sample application.</h2></div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/demo">Open the demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>

<style>
  .pipeline-hero {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) 0 3.8rem;
  }

  .pipeline-hero h1 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0;
    font: 500 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.8rem)/0.99 var(--font-display);
    letter-spacing: -0.075em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .pipeline-hero h1 em {
    color: var(--accent);
    font: italic 400 1em/1 var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .pipeline-hero > .container > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 1.35rem 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .pipeline-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    font: 500 0.54rem var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
  }

  .pipeline-meta i {
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .diagram-section {
    padding: 1.75rem 0 var(--section-space);
  }

  .diagram-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }

  .diagram-heading .section-label {
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .diagram-heading .display-heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .diagram-note {
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    font: 500 0.54rem var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .diagram-card {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-hi);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--paper-raised);
    box-shadow: 0 22px 54px rgba(24, 27, 31, 0.11);
  }

  .diagram-toolbar,
  .diagram-caption {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    font: 500 0.52rem var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .diagram-toolbar {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .diagram-toolbar > span:first-child {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .diagram-toolbar i {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green);
  }

  .diagram-card iframe {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: min(76vw, 800px);
    min-height: 500px;
    border: 0;
    background: var(--plate);
  }

  .diagram-caption {
    min-height: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .diagram-caption a {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .two-column {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 8rem);
  }

  .provenance-card {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-hi);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--paper-raised);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(24, 27, 31, 0.08);
  }

  .provenance-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--dim);
    font: 500 0.52rem var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .claim-node {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 1.1rem 1.1rem 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .claim-node small {
    color: var(--dim);
    font: 500 0.52rem var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .claim-node strong {
    font: 500 0.85rem var(--font-display);
  }

  .trace-line {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px;
    height: 27px;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .trace-line span {
    width: 1px;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .project-node {
    border-color: rgba(20, 121, 93, 0.25);
    background: rgba(20, 121, 93, 0.045);
  }

  .project-node p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .source-nodes {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0.85rem 1.1rem 1.1rem;
  }

  .source-nodes span {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font: 400 0.54rem var(--font-mono);
  }

  .trace-status {
    padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--green);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .trace-status span {
    margin-right: 0.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .matching-section {
    background: rgba(233, 235, 229, 0.55);
  }

  .matching-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .matching-card {
    min-height: 166px;
    padding: 1.15rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-hi);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--paper-raised);
  }

  .matching-index {
    color: var(--dim);
    font: 500 0.52rem var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .matching-card h3 {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.45rem;
    font: 500 0.92rem/1.4 var(--font-display);
  }

  .matching-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
  }

  .matching-evidence {
    border-color: rgba(20, 121, 93, 0.3);
  }

  .matching-evidence .matching-index,
  .matching-result .matching-index {
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .matching-result {
    border-color: rgba(217, 78, 27, 0.28);
  }

  .matching-result h3 {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .matching-arrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .gap-callout {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(157, 98, 13, 0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(157, 98, 13, 0.055);
  }

  .gap-callout span {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--amber);
    font: 500 0.52rem var(--font-mono);
  }

  .gap-callout p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.69rem;
  }

  .pipeline-cta {
    padding-block: 1rem var(--section-space);
  }

  .cta-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-hi);
    border-radius: 13px;
    background: var(--paper-raised);
  }

  .cta-inner .section-label {
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .cta-inner .display-heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.2vw, 3.1rem);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .two-column {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .matching-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .matching-card {
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .matching-card h3 {
      margin-top: 0.9rem;
    }

    .matching-arrow {
      justify-self: center;
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .pipeline-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 12vw, 4rem);
    }

    .diagram-heading,
    .cta-inner {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .diagram-note {
      padding: 0;
    }

    .diagram-card iframe {
      height: 70vh;
      min-height: 400px;
    }

    .diagram-caption {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .gap-callout {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }
  }
</style>
